# The processes' memory without extended memory (roadmap memory.md M4, E3):
# a 512 KB AT with none. The root keeps 128 KB of the memory below 1 MB for
# processes (MEMORY_WITHOUT_EXTENDED), so one of tests/posix/many.c's 16
# children of 60 KB fits, and the others are told there is no memory.
program: idle
define: TEST_POSIX_MANY
memory: 512K 0K
keys: {wait 250}{wait 250}{wait 250}{wait 250}{wait 250}{wait 250}{wait 250}{wait 250}
match: contains
timeout: 120
---
many: 16 children of 60 KB: forked 16, refused 0, sound 1, no memory 15, other 0
